.lua","source":"#GOLD#Mental critical chance#LAST#\nEach time you deal damage with a mental attack you may have a chance to perform a critical hit that deals extra damage.\nSome talents allow you to increase this percentage.\nIt is improved by Cunning.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#精神暴击#LAST#\n每次造成精神伤害时你都有一定几率暴击造成额外伤害。\n一些技能可以提高这个几率。\n提升灵巧属性值可以提高精神暴击。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"411703bd99253d3cd0cb0c03bdc06da30d9707c3d4aebf9ac463fbf28c5c342b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e72c80037bf4390a4d166c12029082cee5c959847bbf47bb8eb6980aab1bf9c","logical_entry_identity":"f6275869da01315fec96f84cacc2bde132d7e2d9252209489f47e580be60c6f2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ethereal Form bonuses reduced by %d%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"虚幻形态加成减少 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"629f5c723622740e59d744963dba1d5cf7b407b6adad15991fa2ea00531c2d25","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e74c0c1fc98d9a3a4ad8d3b8d11d8ab573333dd23b45ca17d74988bd2c9920e","logical_entry_identity":"609b2cd1818115777b4f1321335143eb9b25bc9960084eccb82bf91bfe1ebdcf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Anomaly Intersecting Threads","source_tag":"talent name","target":"异常：时间线交错"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8985332f4da3baf10546bbacb0900c60ca6830f09124bae7951a47dc7e80977b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e77f0b588560a309b7af2bf1b5bfc957ac8481496e4417507f2d5756facf1f9","logical_entry_identity":"095f0bee2ce2ffbe20db1fc2ed060794b9d07cea8e0ce3bafeb7a0cc78986a00","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#AQUAMARINE#The %s no longer seems to be controlled and clatters to the ground before vanishing into a rift.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#AQUAMARINE#%s 似乎失去了控制，坠落在地面，消失在时空裂隙中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6e913fb036423a4da7ddd7ad2c4b86a5a0d2c88e943fd95fbd99b1f407fb59bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e7a502d19e529a81958235f5678a031af7a62298b44dacc2dfba40cf9b4b500","logical_entry_identity":"2