ad entity on the destruction of all things living.","source_tag":"_t","target":"从比漆黑的夜还要深邃的黑暗中，你感受到了一股冰冷的寒意。很久以前它放弃了生命，但却没忘记力量，相反，它被怨恨和邪念所强化，这只扭曲的不死生物要毁灭所有的生者。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"604088b8f03cac7c3c6515bb3d33291ca8410ac0371707b328de44d8d27d4bee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e7fd832a236d971c7f2e3afb6c092f63d054fcb631fc4db9ee740903e2fc829","logical_entry_identity":"5fd1a4c766456b321882e99f5b25ea75683c64795014f029d1000ac61af55317","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You are very crafty. You can now also embed gems into helms and belts.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你心灵手巧，打造技艺已趋于炉火纯青，可以给头盔和腰带镶嵌宝石。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2d1f0249a230d11fc47bbb015f8baf1f36f8e56d3bec2d5126df82a5cf7877b3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e81e7d513e25125adc14efe8f842bb1b55d53a4e586c69fbb3b9c11995a4baa","logical_entry_identity":"31f43c304f589ca5361325ee56f90dae3024936932b9b04e982d6e37ec37aeeb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"In a selfless act, you sacrificed yourself to close the portal to the Void and thus stopped the Creator from bringing about the end of the world.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你无私地牺牲了自己，关闭通往虚空的传送门，从而阻止造物主毁灭世界。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70a9954265c11e138ed49111d22f1ea35e4300f78aaca940023098e954608db5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e84d51ea0f3820e7849db0320959c6f0f5e7dbbfa81ef2fbc43cf82457282bd","logical_entry_identity":"3a7a272bfc57e78ace1b549737368810c50c6622744ff571054bfb1325cb9f94","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You successfully dismantled the trap.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你成功地拆除了这个陷阱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"68744115bcabc60e48f1c37296d41baa7171aafee27f9ad4da3d508ce8546236","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e935a44a9e95aaf1e453ae09f863f9bd56dea870f982e72c55d9762dd8cf2d2","logical_entry_identity":"882fd9990fd5bcc57d751b89b3d3861deb7f75708b1ae3c3b76b4b72b72df746","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"It has a copper head and sharp venomous fangs.","source_tag":"_t","target":"它长着铜色的脑袋和锋利的毒牙。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"238cf77e4e4579d908170ce71b33b705af2722638dd9f252d371b00a68dbe5d1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e942e1dcd3e9ee7c2207c3c96cad93d696bc526eb38827c90cfa4928bd09760","logical_entry_identity":"f55f74b307ee2416a7b74642fd20e708a1d0d10eaecc55d5350fb5a77224fada","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Exp  : #00ff00#%2d%%","source_tag":"tformat","target":"经验：#00ff00#%2d%%"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c8cb66f3238527d11fded54e8cdc5bdeed26d6e791c34b381bb8767589a94d95","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e97138be509519434d2c64300efe0064340c4881b43d55c5dcb63ebb42d25a1","logical_entry_identity":"0d5fd95d1902e7e506310cf8f6f9e55894efcc93c12bc56bd70dbf2ee8a490ac","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":", mind","source_tag":"_t","target":", 精神"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b45a384ccdc433d4bce21543e81dea2a2c7a5deb181a433c2d88f6302f761c96","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3e9978a46f33562cf6f493ceadfb961c403991ac494406087943dd929bfc3bfa","logical_entry_identity":"b48e351b1e65d7c54d8f46baa1259eb20a6de3d8795ec507c8fad497e5c588cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Summon a Rimebark for %d turns to harass your foes. Rimebarks cannot move, but they have a permanent ice storm around them, damaging and freezing anything coming close in a radius of 3.\n\t\tIt will get %d Willpower, %d Cunning and %d Constitution.\n\t\tYour summons inherit some of your stats: increased damage%%, resistance penetration %%, stun/pin/confusion/blindness resistance, armour penetration.\n\t\tTheir Willpower and Cunning will increase with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"召唤 1 棵持续 %d 回合的雾凇骚扰敌人。\n\t\t雾凇不可移动，但是永远有寒冰风暴围绕着它们，伤害并冰冻 3 码半径范围内的任何人。\n\t\t它拥有 %d 点意志，%d 点灵巧和 %d 点体质。\n\t\t你的召唤物继承你部分属性：增加百分比伤害、抗性穿透、震慑/定身/混乱/致盲抵抗和护甲穿透。\n\t\t雾凇的意志和灵巧受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5131a3dee42383761f4b9ae425c1a3d4d774fb8c05